{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"La Vie pour de vrai (Life for Real)","Tridan Lagache a passé sa vie au Club Med, à changer d’amis tous les 8 jours. À 50 ans, il démissionne du club de vacances mexicain où il est né, bien décidé à retrouver, 42 ans plus tard, son grand amour d’enfance, Violette. Il débarque à Paris, naïf et perdu mais heureux d’être hébergé chez Louis, un demi-frère dont il ignorait l’existence. Pour se débarrasser d’un Tridan encombrant, Louis supplie une de ses conquêtes, Roxane, de se faire passer pour Violette que Tridan croit reconnaître au premier regard.",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"new start","urban","brotherhood","independent home","extended family","partnership","fraud",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":32,"media":34,"synopsis":37,"production":39,"characters":45,"roles":66,"awards":92,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_090","fr2023-090-la-vie-pour-de-vrai",{"native":16,"english":17},"La Vie pour de vrai","Life for Real",{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2023-04-19",2023,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":31},"Dany Boon","dany-boon",1966,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[33],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":35,"trailerUrl":36},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/190/0/262334/format_page/la-vie-pour-de-vrai.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AmiRbm2SnNM",{"native":2,"english":38},"",[40,42],{"country":30,"share":41},"Majority coproducer",{"country":43,"share":44},"Belgium","Minority coproducer",[46,57],{"id":47,"film":13,"person":48,"age":50,"gender":29,"sexuality":51,"origin":52,"class":53,"profession":54,"ability":55,"assistedMobility":56},"FR2023_090_01",{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":49},[],"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","Heterosexual","White Western European","Middle class","Unemploy